# Pact witness kernel fixtures are generated by the scripts in this folder.
# Keep the deterministic generators and oracle code in git, not binary outputs.
collab/pact/pact_witness_kernel/*.npz

# APPARATUS Wave 1 hook runtime state (per-machine, per-worktree): window
# markers, fail-open error logs, and the append-only blocker/waiver audit
# ledgers. These are local runtime artifacts, never committed (committing them
# would collide across the multi-agent / multi-worktree setup). The `/*` form
# (ignore everything INSIDE the dir, not the dir itself) lets the one committed
# A4 ledger below be re-included; its lock/tmp/corrupt sidecars stay ignored.
.molt/state/*
# APPARATUS A4: the findings registry is a committed, curated, append-only
# provenance ledger (like pact's canonical-equations registry), seeded with real
# keystones -- re-included here so it IS tracked at origin/main.
!.molt/state/findings_registry.jsonl
